  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Daugavpils DH feasib+demo - Feasibility Daugavpils</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Daugavpils fjv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultinsatser f&#xF6;r feasibility studie och demonstrationsprojekt r&#xF6;rande District Heating System Rehabilitation i Daugavpils i Lettland. Lettisk part &#xE4;r det helt kommun&#xE4;gda fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmebolaget Daugavpils Siltumtikli. Den svenska parten &#xE4;r konsultf&#xF6;retag FVB, Fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmebyr&#xE5;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Finance in Latvia has requested support from Sida to finance a feasibility study regarding a project aiming for the rehabilitation of the district heating system in Daugavpils. Included are also services by the consultant necessary for identification, procurement and implementation of a demonstration project.</narrative>
  </description>
